{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b2c3d4e5-f6a7-8901-bcde-f12345678901",
    "name": "IRoute — Driver Empty Move Flow",
    "description": "EMPTY MOVE FLOW (driver confirms each step)\n\nMODE A — Tenant Location Master:\n  01 Login → 02 Dashboard → 02a Locations → 02b Create\n\nMODE B — Live GPS + address (no 02a):\n  01 Login → 02 Dashboard → 02b-live Create\n\nEXECUTE SEQUENCE (do not skip):\n  03 Job Detail → 04a EM1 Start Pickup → 05 EM2 Depart → 05c EM3 Arrive → 06 EM4 Complete\n\nRULES:\n  - movement_job_id from 02 Dashboard, 02b create, or 03 job detail\n  - content_hash + workflow_version from 03 (refresh after each execute)\n  - Each execute uses a NEW client_action_id (set in prerequest — never reuse)\n  - If EM2 sticks: check replayed=true — re-send with fresh guid\n  - 409 idempotency_key_scope_mismatch = use new client_action_id",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
